{"title": "Artificer's Lore", "pageid": 3963, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Artificer's_Lore", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Artificer%27s_Lore.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Artificer%27s_Lore.webp/300px-Artificer%27s_Lore.webp, /w/images/5/58/Artificer%27s_Lore.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Artificer%27s_Lore.webp/300px-Artificer%27s_Lore.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Artificer%27s_Lore.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Artificer's Lore</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome#Rock_Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Rock Gnomes</a>. They add twice their Proficiency Bonus to History checks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Add twice your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Bonus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/25px-History_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/38px-History_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/50px-History_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"History\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/25px-History_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/History_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\">History</a> checks. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Rock_Gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rock Gnome\">Rock Gnome</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Fuzzalump\" title=\"Sir Fuzzalump\">Sir Fuzzalump</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Although not explicitly stated, this is equivalent to having <a href=\"/wiki/Expertise\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Expertise\">expertise</a> in History checks and will not stack with proficiency or other sources of expertise.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200936\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 second